─────────────────────────────────────────
COMIC MANAGEMENT
─────────────────────────────────────────

ComicManager  (MonoBehaviour — panel registry + loop/panel pointer ONLY)
  │     List<IComicPanel> Panels      (assigned in Inspector; sorted by rank at Start())
  │     IComicPanel CurrentPanel
  │     LoopCount CurrentLoop
  │     AdvancePanel()       ──►  PanelSelector.NextPanel → CommandHistory.Execute(new SwitchCameraCommand)
  │     RetreatPanel()       ──►  CommandHistory.Undo()
  │     RedoPanel()          ──►  CommandHistory.Redo()
  │     ReplayCurrentPanel() ──►  CurrentPanel.Replay()
  └── Does NOT own focus choices — delegates to PlayerChoicesSO

PanelSelector  (plain C# — pure static helper, no MonoBehaviour)
  │     static IComicPanel NextPanel(List<IComicPanel> panels, IComicPanel current, LoopCount loop)
  └── Eligibility rule: firstLoop <= currentLoop <= lastLoop
      All loop-eligibility logic lives here only — never duplicated elsewhere

CommandHistory  (plain C# — two-stack undo/redo)
  │     Stack<ICommand> _history      (panels visited so far)
  │     Stack<ICommand> _future       (panels available to go forward to after Undo)
  │     Execute(ICommand cmd)         (push to history, clear future, cmd.Execute())
  │     Undo()                        (pop history → push future → cmd.Undo())
  │     Redo()                        (pop future → push history → cmd.Redo())
  └── Named "History" not "Queue" — models undo/redo, not FIFO processing

